# This package reads no environment variable and needs no key to run its tests.
#
# The one value a deployment should set is PROOF_SALT, and it is a Worker
# secret, not a file: `npx wrangler secret put PROOF_SALT`. It salts the
# truncated User-Agent hash in the proof log. Without it the salt falls back to
# the `site` key, which is public. Costs nothing.
#
# For `wrangler dev`, put it in example/.dev.vars (gitignored); see
# example/.dev.vars.example.
